- {{Nov. 2026 - Our paper, &quot;MedSense: Metasurface-Enhanced mmWave Sensing for Liquid Medication Verification&quot;, was conditionally accepted by <strong><em>ACM MobiCom 2027</em></strong>. Congratulations to Yeyu!}}
- {{Nov. 2026 - Our paper, &quot;FairMGRL: Large-Scale USV Dispatching with Different Tasks via Masked Graph Pretraining and Fairness-Aware Decoding&quot;, was accepted by <strong><em>IEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing</em></strong>. Congratulations to Lingzi!}}
- {{Sep. 2026 - Our paper, &quot;A<sup>2</sup>: Characterizing and Mitigating Imbalanced Reclaim in MGLRU via Active Aging at Production Scale&quot;, was accepted by <strong><em>ACM SIGOPS ATC 2026</em></strong>. Congratulations to Fei!}}
- {{Sep. 2026 - Our paper, &quot;Scaling LLMs via Collaboration: Efficient LLM Inference Across Resource-Constrained Devices&quot;, was accepted by <strong><em>IEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing</em></strong>. Congratulations to Fei!}}
- {{July 2026 - Our paper, &quot;MetaNav: Metacognitive Vision-Language Navigation via Reflective Exploration&quot;, was accepted by <strong><em>ACM MM 2026</em></strong>. Congratulations to Xueying!}}
- {{June 2026 - Our paper, &quot;A3TP: Automated, Accurate, and Adaptive UAV Task Planning for Power Transmission Networks Inspection&quot;, was accepted by <strong><em>ACM MobiCom 2026</em></strong>. Congratulations to Qiyong!}}
- {{June 2026 - Our paper, &quot;KAT: Knowledge-Context Augmentation for Evolving LLM-Based Telecom Troubleshooting&quot;, was accepted by <strong><em>IEEE INFOCOM 2026</em></strong>. Congratulations to Kai!}}
- {{Feb. 2026 - Our paper, &quot;U-Mesh+: Terrain-Aware, Robust, and Cost-Efficient UAV-Mesh Network Deployment for Inspection Tasks in Remote Areas&quot;, was accepted by <strong><em>IEEE Transactions on Networking</em></strong>. Congratulations to Jieyu!}}
- {{Feb. 2026 - Our paper, &quot;Exploring Cellular User Re-Identification Risks with Networking Behaviors Analysis and Modeling&quot;, was accepted by <strong><em>IEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing</em></strong>. Congratulations to Sijing!}}
- {{Dec. 2025 - Our paper, &quot;Game in Motion: Heterogeneous Task Offloading in Dynamic Vehicular Edge Computing&quot;, was accepted by <strong><em>IEEE Transactions on Networking</em></strong>. Congratulations to Jie!}}
- {{Nov. 2025 - Our paper, &quot;Auto-UIT: Automating UAV Inspection Trajectory by Recognizing Pylon Structure from 3D Point Cloud&quot;, was accepted by <strong><em>ACM MobiCom 2025</em></strong>. Congratulations to Lijuan!}}
- {{Nov. 2025 - Our paper, &quot;H2O: Heterogeneity-Aware Hierarchical Orchestration for Memory-Efficient on-Device LLM Inference&quot;, was accepted by <strong><em>IEEE Transactions on Mobile Computing</em></strong>. Congratulations to Fei!}}
